{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12311500","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12311500","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1231150001:1":{"text":"値段を気にしなくていいなら、もちろん泊まりたいわよ！","source_cn":"不考虑价格问题，谁不想呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB04FA97EDA373FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1231150002:1":{"text":"ここからの眺めは、ラスティーアンカーで最高らしいからね。","source_cn":"据说那间高级套房拥有整个锈锚港最好的视野。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E9137BD6977CEF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1231150003:1":{"text":"それに、ここに泊まれば最高のサービスを受けられるはずよ。","source_cn":"而且住在那里，你将会享受到最贴心的服务。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x842DE9009F9294B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1231150004:1":{"text":"スタンダードルームに泊まってると、私たちが呼んでもスタッフが素知らぬふりをするんだけどね。","source_cn":"不像我们这些住普通房间的，侍者总喜欢对我们的召唤假装看不见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28296DFA926ED8A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:居民丽卢雷特":{"text":"住民リルレット","source":"居民丽卢雷特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}